/T (The scope of this report is limited to the Java Full Stack Development learning areas confirmed by the internship certificate. It covers the concepts and practical understanding gained across front- end development, core and advanced Java programming, back-end development with Spring, database interaction, and version control. )
/E (The scope of this report is limited to the Java Full Stack Development learning areas confirmed by the internship certificate. It covers the concepts and practical understanding gained across front- end development, core and advanced Java programming, back-end development with Spring, database interaction, and version control. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
