145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 75 0 R
/T (A modern web application has to bring together an approachable interface, dependable business logic, and structured data storage. It is common for a student to understand HTML, Java, Spring, and MySQL individually while still struggling to see how they operate as one working system. This internship was designed to close that gap by building a practical, layer-by-layer understanding of a Java-based full-stack application. )
/E (A modern web application has to bring together an approachable interface, dependable business logic, and structured data storage. It is common for a student to understand HTML, Java, Spring, and MySQL individually while still struggling to see how they operate as one working system. This internship was designed to close that gap by building a practical, layer-by-layer understanding of a Java-based full-stack application. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
