/T (The technologies covered in the internship map onto a layered full-stack architecture: a presentation layer that the user sees and interacts with, an application layer that processes requests and business logic, a persistence layer that connects the application to stored data, and a database layer that holds that data. Git supports the development process across all of these layers. )
