/Title (The biggest lesson for me was the value of pacing myself. With so many technologies covered across eight weeks, trying to master everything at once would have been overwhelming; breaking the material into weekly, layered modules made it manageable, and I became more comfortable treating debugging as a normal, expected part of development rather than a setback.)
